### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@mockProviderClerkId = user_mock_provider_01
@mockClientClerkId = user_mock_client_01

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. User Sign-Up via Clerk Webhook Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "user.created",
  "data": {
    "id": "user_clerk_test_1001",
    "first_name": "David",
    "last_name": "Miller",
    "primary_email_address_id": "email_1001",
    "email_addresses": [
      {
        "id": "email_1001",
        "email_address": "david.miller@example.com"
      }
    ],
    "public_metadata": {
      "role": "CLIENT"
    }
  }
}

### 3. User Sign-Up via Frontend Direct Sync Endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clerkId": "user_clerk_test_2002",
  "email": "emily.watson@example.com",
  "firstName": "Emily",
  "lastName": "Watson",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### 4. Verify Signed-Up User (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
x-user-clerk-id: user_clerk_test_2002

### 5. Upgrade User to Provider & Set Public Handle
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/role
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-clerk-id: user_clerk_test_2002

{
  "role": "PROVIDER",
  "handle": "emily-consulting",
  "timezone": "America/New_York"
}

### 6. Public Provider Profile
# @name getPublicProfile
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/alex-morgan

### 7. Public Available Slots (Timezone-Safe Calculation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/alex-morgan/slots?date=2026-08-26&timezone=Asia/Kolkata

### 8. Initiate Stripe Checkout Session (Lock Slot & Get Payment URL)
# @name createCheckout
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/checkout/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerHandle": "alex-morgan",
  "serviceId": "REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_ID",
  "startTimeUTC": "2026-08-26T14:00:00.000Z",
  "endTimeUTC": "2026-08-26T14:30:00.000Z",
  "clientName": "Michael Scott",
  "clientEmail": "michael.scott@example.com",
  "clientTimezone": "America/New_York"
}

### 9. Simulate Stripe Webhook: checkout.session.completed (Confirm Booking & Issue Invoice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_mock_12345678",
      "payment_status": "paid",
      "metadata": {
        "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID"
      }
    }
  }
}

### 10. Check Booking Status & Invoice Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/bookings/234154f3-1693-4670-8cd4-0209ad1ae4a6

### 11. Download Dynamic PDF Invoice (Streams PDF buffer directly)
# Open this URL directly in your browser: http://localhost:5000/api/invoices/INV-2026-0002/download
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/INV-2026-0002/download

### 12. View Invoice JSON Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/INV-2026-0002

### 11. Provider Services List
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider/services
x-user-clerk-id: {{mockProviderClerkId}}

### 12. Provider Create Service
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider/services
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-clerk-id: {{mockProviderClerkId}}

{
  "title": "45-Min System Design & Strategy Review",
  "description": "Interactive architectural review and scaling recommendations.",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "price": 120.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "isActive": true
}

### 13. Provider Availability Schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider/availability
x-user-clerk-id: {{mockProviderClerkId}}

### 14. Provider Update Weekly Working Hours
PUT {{baseUrl}}/provider/availability
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-clerk-id: {{mockProviderClerkId}}

{
  "availabilities": [
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 2, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 3, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 4, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 5, "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "16:00" }
  ]
}
